            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Coco Vert Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Wayne K\nKuching, Malaysia775 contributions\n0\nFood poisoning from this restaurant, highly unrecommended!\nMar 2018 • Family\nHad a very bad experience at this restaurant earlier this year in March. I tried a few restaurants around in Nha Trang and they all turned out cheaper and much nicer than this restaurant! Had it not been for my tour guide, I would not have even come here. Service was not fantastic as well, when I didn't order more food, seems like they were not too enthusiastic about serving me. The worse thing is that the beancurd (toufu) was sour and after consuming it, my mum had very bad food poisoning for the rest of the day, vomiting and diarrhea non stop. My dad and I had our turn the next day after we arrived back home. Thank God we were able to fly back home despite the food poisoning. Honestly, I would not recommend this place to anyone at all. You can take your chance though if you want. Hope they will improve.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten November 6, 2018",
